{"type":"route","meta":{"status":200,"headers":{"cache-control":"public, max-age=3600, s-maxage=86400","content-type":"text/plain; charset=utf-8","x-next-cache-tags":"_N_T_/layout,_N_T_/llms.txt/layout,_N_T_/llms.txt/route,_N_T_/llms.txt"}},"body":"# TUGGI\n\n> TUGGI is a self-guided audio travel guide app (iOS & Android). Audio stories about the places around you trigger automatically by GPS as you drive, walk, or cycle — screen-off and offline. Free to start, available in 10 languages with synchronized closed captions.\n\nKey facts:\n- Category: travel app / self-guided audio tours / cultural audio guide\n- Platforms: iOS and Android — free to download\n- Passes: optional Tuggi Passes of 10, 25 or 45 hours of use — one-time purchase, the hours do not expire\n- Works offline; audio triggers automatically by location; 10 languages with captions\n- Not a navigation app — it runs alongside your GPS and music and narrates the places you pass\n- App Store: https://apps.apple.com/app/tuggi-drive/id6744379818\n- Google Play: https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id=com.tuggidrive.app\n\n## Main pages\n- [Home](https://www.tuggi.app/en): What TUGGI is and how it works\n- [Download / Drive](https://www.tuggi.app/en/drive): Features, pricing, FAQ, and app download\n- [Audio Tours](https://www.tuggi.app/en/tours): Self-guided audio tour routes by destination — each route page has a map, the ordered stops, real audio previews, duration, accessibility and languages\n- [Global Coverage](https://www.tuggi.app/en/coverage): Countries and number of attractions covered (live stats)\n- [Technology](https://www.tuggi.app/en/technology): How the location-triggered audio engine works\n- [Purpose](https://www.tuggi.app/en/purpose): Mission and accessibility\n\n\n## Audio tour routes\n\nEach route page carries a map, the ordered stops with real audio previews, duration, distance, accessibility and the languages it is narrated in.\n\n### Brazil (26 routes)\n- [All routes in Brazil](https://www.tuggi.app/en/tours/brazil)\n**Rio de Janeiro** (16)\n- [Rio's Wonders in a Day](https://www.tuggi.app/en/tours/brazil/as-maravilhas-do-rio-em-um-dia): Rio de Janeiro, Brazil — 2h 21min, 76.5 km, 13 stops, 4 languages\n- [Conservatória, a Capital da Seresta](https://www.tuggi.app/pt/tours/brazil/conservatoria-a-capital-da-seresta): Conservatória, Rio de Janeiro, Brazil — 25 min, 18.8 km, 11 stops, 1 language\n- [Rio's Beaches: From Botafogo to Grumari](https://www.tuggi.app/en/tours/brazil/praias-do-rio-de-botafogo-a-grumari): Rio de Janeiro, Brazil — 2h 33min, 99.6 km, 13 stops, 4 languages\n- [Região dos Lagos em Um Dia](https://www.tuggi.app/pt/tours/brazil/regiao-dos-lagos-em-um-dia): Região dos Lagos, Rio de Janeiro, Brazil — 8h 39min, 111.5 km, 10 stops, 1 language\n- [\"Bohemian Rio\"](https://www.tuggi.app/en/tours/brazil/rio-boemio): Rio de Janeiro, Brazil — 49 min, 30.4 km, 9 stops, 4 languages\n- [Rota da Cachaça](https://www.tuggi.app/pt/tours/brazil/rota-da-cachaca): Vale do Café, Rio de Janeiro, Brazil — 3h 45min, 180.5 km, 7 stops, 1 language\n- [Rota do Café](https://www.tuggi.app/pt/tours/brazil/rota-do-cafe): Vale do Café, Rio de Janeiro, Brazil — 6h 42min, 298.5 km, 17 stops, 1 language\n- [Rota do Festival Sabores de Cabo Frio 2026](https://www.tuggi.app/pt/tours/brazil/rota-do-festival-sabores-de-cabo-frio-2026): Cabo Frio, Rio de Janeiro, Brazil — 1h 55min, 55.4 km, 72 stops, 1 language\n- [Búzios Heritage Trail](https://www.tuggi.app/en/tours/brazil/rota-do-patrimonio-tombado-de-buzios): Armação dos Búzios, Rio de Janeiro, Brazil — 44 min, 26.5 km, 4 stops, 2 languages\n- [Rota do Queijo de Valença](https://www.tuggi.app/pt/tours/brazil/rota-do-queijo-de-valenca): Vale do Café, Rio de Janeiro, Brazil — 1h 3min, 50.1 km, 6 stops, 1 language\n- [Rota Gastronômica de Conservatória](https://www.tuggi.app/pt/tours/brazil/rota-gastronomica-de-conservatoria): Conservatória, Rio de Janeiro, Brazil — 14 min, 6 km, 12 stops, 1 language\n- [Rota Histórica e Cultural da Orla Bardot](https://www.tuggi.app/pt/tours/brazil/rota-historica-e-cultural-da-orla-bardot): Armação dos Búzios, Rio de Janeiro, Brazil — 19 min, 9 km, 9 stops, 1 language\n- [The Religious Route of Búzios](https://www.tuggi.app/en/tours/brazil/rota-religiosa-de-buzios): Armação dos Búzios, Rio de Janeiro, Brazil — 25 min, 14.3 km, 5 stops, 2 languages\n- [Trilha da Brava ao Forno](https://www.tuggi.app/pt/tours/brazil/trilha-da-brava-ao-forno): Armação dos Búzios, Rio de Janeiro, Brazil — 4 min, 1.4 km, 3 stops, 1 language\n- [Trilha da Ponta do Pai Vitório](https://www.tuggi.app/pt/tours/brazil/trilha-da-ponta-do-pai-vitorio): Armação dos Búzios, Rio de Janeiro, Brazil — 7 min, 3.2 km, 2 stops, 1 language\n- [Trilha do Canto, Amores e Tartaruga](https://www.tuggi.app/pt/tours/brazil/trilha-do-canto-amores-e-tartaruga): Armação dos Búzios, Rio de Janeiro, Brazil — 18 min, 8 km, 3 stops, 1 language\n\n**São Paulo** (6)\n- [Paulista Avenue and Its Surroundings](https://www.tuggi.app/en/tours/brazil/avenida-paulista-e-arredores): São Paulo, Brazil — 1h 35min, 52.8 km, 14 stops, 4 languages\n- [Circuito dos Santuários de Aparecida](https://www.tuggi.app/pt/tours/brazil/circuito-dos-santuarios-de-aparecida): Aparecida, São Paulo, Brazil — 17 min, 7.5 km, 5 stops, 1 language\n- [Rota da Luz](https://www.tuggi.app/pt/tours/brazil/rota-da-luz): Vale do Paraíba, São Paulo, Brazil — 5h 18min, 237.4 km, 8 stops, 1 language\n- [São Paulo by Night](https://www.tuggi.app/en/tours/brazil/sao-paulo-a-noite): São Paulo, Brazil — 1h 1min, 30.9 km, 12 stops, 4 languages\n- [São Paulo with Kids](https://www.tuggi.app/en/tours/brazil/sao-paulo-com-criancas): São Paulo, Brazil — 1h 55min, 64.7 km, 9 stops, 4 languages\n- [São Paulo Sports Scene](https://www.tuggi.app/en/tours/brazil/sao-paulo-esportiva): São Paulo, Brazil — 4h 18min, 201.6 km, 10 stops, 4 languages\n\n### Portugal (10 routes)\n- [All routes in Portugal](https://www.tuggi.app/en/tours/portugal)\n- [Christ the King and the Other Side of the Tagus](https://www.tuggi.app/en/tours/portugal/cristo-rei-e-o-outro-lado-do-tejo): Lisboa, Portugal — 51 min, 41.3 km, 8 stops, 4 languages\n- [The Tram 28](https://www.tuggi.app/en/tours/portugal/eletrico-28): Lisboa, Portugal — 31 min, 14.2 km, 14 stops, 4 languages\n- [Furnas, Termas e Vulcões](https://www.tuggi.app/pt/tours/portugal/furnas-termas-e-vulcoes): Açores — São Miguel, Portugal — 1h 59min, 64.4 km, 7 stops, 1 language\n- [Lisbon Grand Tour](https://www.tuggi.app/en/tours/portugal/grande-volta-de-lisboa): Lisboa, Portugal — 1h 14min, 43.1 km, 20 stops, 4 languages\n- [Historic Lisbon](https://www.tuggi.app/en/tours/portugal/lisboa-historica): Lisboa, Portugal — 12 min, 5.5 km, 6 stops, 4 languages\n- [Nordeste de São Miguel](https://www.tuggi.app/pt/tours/portugal/nordeste-de-sao-miguel): Açores — São Miguel, Portugal — 2h 43min, 87.7 km, 8 stops, 1 language\n- [Ponta Delgada, a Capital Açoriana](https://www.tuggi.app/pt/tours/portugal/ponta-delgada-a-capital-acoriana): Açores — São Miguel, Portugal — 26 min, 9.4 km, 8 stops, 1 language\n- [Ponta Delgada a Pé](https://www.tuggi.app/pt/tours/portugal/ponta-delgada-a-pe): Açores — São Miguel, Portugal — 25 min, 8.5 km, 8 stops, 1 language\n- [Sete Cidades e a Costa Oeste](https://www.tuggi.app/pt/tours/portugal/sete-cidades-e-a-costa-oeste): Açores — São Miguel, Portugal — 4h 47min, 135 km, 8 stops, 1 language\n- [Sintra and its Palaces](https://www.tuggi.app/en/tours/portugal/sintra-e-seus-palacios): Sintra, Portugal — 2h 7min, 90.9 km, 10 stops, 4 languages\n\n### Spain (27 routes)\n- [All routes in Spain](https://www.tuggi.app/en/tours/spain)\n- [Barcelona da Guerra Civil](https://www.tuggi.app/pt/tours/spain/barcelona-da-guerra-civil): Catalunya, Spain — 21 min, 10.3 km, 3 stops, 1 language\n- [Barcelona en 1 Día](https://www.tuggi.app/es/tours/spain/barcelona-em-1-dia): Catalunya, Spain — 58 min, 21.1 km, 8 stops, 2 languages\n- [Barcelona Olímpica 1992](https://www.tuggi.app/pt/tours/spain/barcelona-olimpica-1992): Catalunya, Spain — 33 min, 13.1 km, 6 stops, 1 language\n- [Barcelona Religiosa](https://www.tuggi.app/pt/tours/spain/barcelona-religiosa): Catalunya, Spain — 1h 12min, 32.5 km, 7 stops, 1 language\n- [Barceloneta e Vila Olímpica a Pé](https://www.tuggi.app/pt/tours/spain/barceloneta-e-vila-olimpica-a-pe): Catalunya, Spain — 59 min, 4.5 km, 7 stops, 1 language\n- [Bus Turístic — Linha Azul](https://www.tuggi.app/pt/tours/spain/bus-turistic-linha-azul): Catalunya, Spain — 1h 19min, 37 km, 9 stops, 1 language\n- [Bus Turístic — Linha Vermelha](https://www.tuggi.app/pt/tours/spain/bus-turistic-linha-vermelha): Catalunya, Spain — 1h 33min, 36.6 km, 18 stops, 1 language\n- [De Barcelona a Figueres e Cadaqués](https://www.tuggi.app/pt/tours/spain/de-barcelona-a-figueres-e-cadaques): Catalunya, Spain — 3h 8min, 189.8 km, 8 stops, 1 language\n- [De Barcelona a Girona e Costa Brava](https://www.tuggi.app/pt/tours/spain/de-barcelona-a-girona-e-costa-brava): Catalunya, Spain — 3h 37min, 209.7 km, 9 stops, 1 language\n- [De Barcelona a Montserrat e Colònia Güell](https://www.tuggi.app/pt/tours/spain/de-barcelona-a-montserrat-e-colonia-guell): Catalunya, Spain — 1h 9min, 60.8 km, 4 stops, 1 language\n- [De Barcelona a Sitges e Penedès](https://www.tuggi.app/pt/tours/spain/de-barcelona-a-sitges-e-penedes): Catalunya, Spain — 1h 9min, 63.2 km, 8 stops, 1 language\n- [De Barcelona a Tarragona Romana](https://www.tuggi.app/pt/tours/spain/de-barcelona-a-tarragona-romana): Catalunya, Spain — 1h 29min, 99.3 km, 8 stops, 1 language\n- [De Madrid a Alcalá de Henares e Aranjuez](https://www.tuggi.app/pt/tours/spain/de-madrid-a-alcala-de-henares-e-aranjuez): Madrid, Spain — 1h 47min, 110.8 km, 6 stops, 1 language\n- [De Madrid a El Escorial e Ávila](https://www.tuggi.app/pt/tours/spain/de-madrid-a-el-escorial-e-avila): Madrid, Castilla y León, Spain — 1h 45min, 109.6 km, 6 stops, 1 language\n- [De Madrid a Segóvia](https://www.tuggi.app/pt/tours/spain/de-madrid-a-segovia): Castilla y León, Spain — 1h 43min, 98.5 km, 5 stops, 1 language\n- [De Madrid a Toledo](https://www.tuggi.app/pt/tours/spain/de-madrid-a-toledo): Castilla-La Mancha, Spain — 1h 23min, 84.9 km, 6 stops, 1 language\n- [Eixample Modernista a Pé](https://www.tuggi.app/pt/tours/spain/eixample-modernista-a-pe): Catalunya, Spain — 28 min, 2.1 km, 8 stops, 1 language\n- [Els Emblemàtics — Lojas Centenárias](https://www.tuggi.app/pt/tours/spain/els-emblematics-lojas-centenarias): Catalunya, Spain — 23 min, 1.7 km, 7 stops, 1 language\n- [Gaudí Essencial](https://www.tuggi.app/pt/tours/spain/gaudi-essencial): Catalunya, Spain — 1h, 25 km, 9 stops, 1 language\n- [Gòtic e Born a Pé](https://www.tuggi.app/pt/tours/spain/gotic-e-born-a-pe): Catalunya, Spain — 19 min, 1.4 km, 11 stops, 1 language\n- [Goya em Madrid](https://www.tuggi.app/pt/tours/spain/goya-em-madrid): Madrid, Spain — 16 min, 7.3 km, 4 stops, 1 language\n- [Gràcia e Park Güell a Pé](https://www.tuggi.app/pt/tours/spain/gracia-e-park-guell-a-pe): Catalunya, Spain — 28 min, 2.1 km, 4 stops, 1 language\n- [Madrid dos Áustrias a Pé](https://www.tuggi.app/pt/tours/spain/madrid-dos-austrias-a-pe): Madrid, Spain — 15 min, 1.2 km, 6 stops, 1 language\n- [Madrid dos Bourbons a Pé](https://www.tuggi.app/pt/tours/spain/madrid-dos-bourbons-a-pe): Madrid, Spain — 25 min, 1.9 km, 6 stops, 1 language\n- [Madrid em 1 Dia](https://www.tuggi.app/pt/tours/spain/madrid-em-1-dia): Madrid, Spain — 22 min, 8.7 km, 9 stops, 1 language\n- [Montjuïc a Pé](https://www.tuggi.app/pt/tours/spain/montjuic-a-pe): Catalunya, Spain — 54 min, 4 km, 9 stops, 1 language\n- [Paseo del Arte a Pé](https://www.tuggi.app/pt/tours/spain/paseo-del-arte-a-pe): Madrid, Spain — 19 min, 1.5 km, 5 stops, 1 language\n\n### United States (14 routes)\n- [All routes in United States](https://www.tuggi.app/en/tours/united-states)\n**New York** (7)\n- [Brooklyn and Queens](https://www.tuggi.app/en/tours/united-states/brooklyn-e-queens): New York, United States — 50 min, 27.9 km, 10 stops, 4 languages\n- [Movie Scenes in New York](https://www.tuggi.app/en/tours/united-states/cenas-de-cinema-em-nova-york): New York, United States — 1h 5min, 30 km, 12 stops, 4 languages\n- [Central Park, from South to North](https://www.tuggi.app/en/tours/united-states/central-park-do-sul-ao-norte): New York, United States — 31 min, 13 km, 12 stops, 4 languages\n- [Midtown Manhattan Icons](https://www.tuggi.app/en/tours/united-states/icones-de-midtown-manhattan): New York, United States — 34 min, 18.2 km, 12 stops, 4 languages\n- [The \"Friends\" Fan's New York](https://www.tuggi.app/en/tours/united-states/nova-york-dos-fas-de-friends): New York, United States — 40 min, 18.2 km, 10 stops, 4 languages\n- [New York City Across the Bridges](https://www.tuggi.app/en/tours/united-states/nova-york-pelas-pontes): New York, United States — 56 min, 29.7 km, 10 stops, 4 languages\n- [Wall Street and the Financial District](https://www.tuggi.app/en/tours/united-states/wall-street-e-o-financial-district): New York, United States — 50 min, 25.1 km, 12 stops, 4 languages\n\n**Florida** (3)\n- [Shopping in Orlando](https://www.tuggi.app/en/tours/united-states/compras-em-orlando): Orlando, Florida, United States — 1h 53min, 82 km, 12 stops, 4 languages\n- [From Orlando to the Space Coast](https://www.tuggi.app/en/tours/united-states/de-orlando-a-space-coast): Space Coast, Florida, United States — 8h 17min, 310.1 km, 13 stops, 4 languages\n- [Free Disney, No Tickets Needed](https://www.tuggi.app/en/tours/united-states/disney-de-graca-sem-ingressos): Orlando, Florida, United States — 1h 58min, 60.2 km, 14 stops, 4 languages\n\n**Georgia** (3)\n- [Classic Atlanta](https://www.tuggi.app/en/tours/united-states/atlanta-classica): Atlanta, Georgia, United States — 1h 1min, 36.6 km, 14 stops, 4 languages\n- [Kennesaw and Marietta](https://www.tuggi.app/en/tours/united-states/kennesaw-e-marietta): North Georgia, Georgia, United States — 1h 40min, 86.4 km, 12 stops, 4 languages\n- [Stone Mountain and Atlanta's Parks](https://www.tuggi.app/en/tours/united-states/stone-mountain-e-os-parques-de-atlanta): Atlanta, Georgia, United States — 3h 31min, 164.7 km, 14 stops, 4 languages\n\n**New Jersey** (1)\n- [Statue of Liberty and the New Jersey Side](https://www.tuggi.app/en/tours/united-states/estatua-da-liberdade-e-o-lado-de-nova-jersey): New York, New Jersey, United States — 1h 13min, 42.6 km, 9 stops, 4 languages\n\n\n## Updates\n\nWhat changed in the app, when it changed, and what happens to what a traveller already bought.\n\n- [All updates](https://www.tuggi.app/en/updates): the full record, newest first\n- [The hour passes are here](https://www.tuggi.app/en/updates/hour-passes): release note, 2026-08-30 — You buy hours of guide, and your balance runs while the guide is on. The map, the descriptions and the events nearby cost no hours at all.\n- [When the guide starts talking](https://www.tuggi.app/en/updates/audio-guide-that-starts-on-its-own): product news, 2026-08-30 — You come near a place worth hearing and the story starts, with no typing, no stopping the car and no looking at the screen.\n\n## For businesses\n- [Destinations](https://www.tuggi.app/en/destinations): For cities and tourism boards\n- [Fleets](https://www.tuggi.app/en/enterprise/fleets): For car-rental and mobility fleets\n- [Contact](https://www.tuggi.app/en/contact): Talk to the team\n\n## Trust & legal\n- [Privacy Policy](https://www.tuggi.app/en/trust-center/privacy-policy)\n- [Terms of Use](https://www.tuggi.app/en/trust-center/terms-of-use)\n- [Accessibility](https://www.tuggi.app/en/trust-center/accessibility)\n"}